<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Allergan cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Allergan cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst David Sobell said he lowered Allergan Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the ophthalmic pharmaceuticals, lens care and surgical concern were off 7/8 to 33-7/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;We do not expect an EPS breakout starting next year, as previously envisioned,&quot; Sobell said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
